:: adidas-box {"position": "300,500", "size": "100,100"}
<div class="passage-content">
Let's look at the back of your jersey.

Look at the Adidas logo on the back of the neck.

It should be a patch, with the backing material being the same color as the jersey itself (in most cases). The "box" it sits in should be just big enough for it, and the logo should sit level.

What describes your logo?
</div>

